                                      &deleted_visits, max_visits);
 
+  // aerographene (ADR 0007): move instead of delete. History-Cold is written
+  // and committed first; if that fails nothing leaves the hot database and the
+  // batch is retried on a later iteration. A crash between the cold commit and
+  // the hot commit only leaves duplicates, which the cold inserts ignore.
+  std::set<URLID> copied_url_ids;
